    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-open\r\n->\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-rules-for-choosing-a-browsing-context-given-a-browsing-context-name\r\n\"If the user agent has been configured such that in this instance it will create a new browsing context:\"\r\n\r\n(I'm not sure why this does not call https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context ?)\r\n\r\nback to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-open\r\n\r\nstep 5 sets *new*  to true.\r\n\r\nstep 7 parses URL into *resource*\r\n\r\nstep 8 invokes https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#navigate which says\r\n\r\n\"When it comes time to set the document's address, use *address* as the override URL.\"",
